---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Contact Honest Picture"
  description="Get in touch with Honest Picture — corrections, source suggestions, feedback, privacy requests, press, and advertising enquiries. We read everything and especially want to hear about errors."
  path="/contact"
  eyebrow="Contact"
  heading="Get in touch."
  lede="We read everything, and we especially want to hear about errors. Accuracy is the whole point of this site."
>
  <h2>Email us</h2>
  <p>
    The best — and fastest — way to reach us is by email at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. A real person reads every
    message, and we aim to respond within a few business days. To help us reply
    well, please include the specific page (a URL is ideal) and as much detail as
    you can.
  </p>

  <h2>What to write about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Corrections.</strong> If a figure looks wrong or out of date, tell us
      — include the page and, if you can, a source. We review every correction and
      will fix or annotate the page.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Source suggestions.</strong> If there is a study, dataset, or survey
      we should be citing, send it along. We keep a full
      <a href="/data-sources">source list</a> and are always improving it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Feedback.</strong> Did the assessment or an insight page help you see
      something more clearly — or get something wrong about your situation? That
      feedback directly shapes what we build and rewrite.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Privacy and data requests.</strong> To ask about your data or exercise
      a privacy right (access, deletion, opt-out), email us with "Privacy" in the
      subject line. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> for details.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Advertising and partnerships.</strong> For advertising, media, or
      collaboration enquiries, use the same address with "Advertising" or "Press" in
      the subject line.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Legal.</strong> For legal notices or questions about our
      <a href="/terms">terms of use</a>, email us with "Legal" in the subject line.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Response times</h2>
  <p>
    We are a small team, so we cannot promise instant replies, but we do read and
    triage everything. Corrections and privacy requests are prioritised. If your
    message needs research on our end, we will acknowledge it and follow up.
  </p>

  <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
  <p>
    We cannot offer personal financial, medical, legal, or psychological advice, and
    we cannot respond to emergencies or crises. If you are struggling or in danger,
    please contact a qualified professional or your local emergency or crisis
    service. In the U.S., you can call or text <strong>988</strong> to reach the
    Suicide and Crisis Lifeline, available 24/7. Outside the U.S., please search for
    your local crisis line or emergency number.
  </p>

  <h2>Your privacy when you contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Anything you email us is used only to respond to you. We do not add you to any
    marketing list, and we do not sell or share your details. See our
    <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> and
    <a href="/how-we-use-data">how we use data</a> for the full picture.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
